# --- NOTE: assets/ is intentionally NOT ignored (tracked figures for the README) ---

# --- Credentials: NEVER commit ---
# Added 2026-09-17 at the CTA-EDGE-04-MMV data freeze. The MMV lineage needs a
# FRED/ALFRED API key on this machine; nothing in this file previously stopped a
# `git add -A` from committing one. These patterns are preventive, not reactive:
# no credential has ever been committed to this repository.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
secrets.json
.secrets
config.local.py
*.key
*.pem
.fredapikey
.fred_api_key
.alfredapikey
